          "passageId": "ws18h-p6",
          "text": {
            "en": "As his arrows ran out and the floodwaters rose, Pang De told his commander Cheng He that a worthy general does not fear death, and that today was his day to die.",
            "zht": "矢盡水漲之際，龐德對其將成何說，賢將不畏死以求生，今日便是他的死期。",
            "zhs": "矢尽水涨之际，庞德对其将成何说，贤将不畏死以求生，今日便是他的死期。"
          }
        }
