          "passageId": "ws18h-p8",
          "text": {
            "en": "Pang Hui was Pang De's son; bold and resolute like his father, he rose to become Commandant of the Capital and General, and was granted the rank of Marquis.",
            "zht": "龐會是龐德之子，果烈有父風，官至中尉、將軍，獲封列侯。",
            "zhs": "庞会是庞德之子，果烈有父风，官至中尉、将军，获封列侯。"
